# Hogwarts — a temporal memory corpus (10 dated turns). Pairs with
# hogwarts_temporal.questions.yaml. Fed in timestamp order so a later fact supersedes an
# earlier one. Several properties change over the years (DADA teacher, Harry's broom, the
# Minister for Magic, Ron's pet) — so the *current* value can only be picked by temporal
# reasoning (valid_at / invalid_at, latest-wins), not by text search (which sees them all).
{"id": "hp_01", "timestamp": "1991-09-02T09:00:00Z", "type": "text", "body": "This year Professor Quirinus Quirrell is the Defence Against the Dark Arts teacher at Hogwarts. Harry Potter flies a Nimbus 2000 broomstick."}
{"id": "hp_02", "timestamp": "1992-09-01T09:00:00Z", "type": "text", "body": "A new term begins: Gilderoy Lockhart has taken over as the Defence Against the Dark Arts teacher."}
{"id": "hp_03", "timestamp": "1993-06-15T17:00:00Z", "type": "text", "body": "Disaster on the Quidditch pitch — Harry's Nimbus 2000 was blown into the Whomping Willow and smashed to splinters. The broom is gone for good."}
{"id": "hp_04", "timestamp": "1993-09-01T09:00:00Z", "type": "text", "body": "Remus Lupin is the Defence Against the Dark Arts teacher this year. Harry has a new broom now — a Firebolt, the fastest racing broom made."}
{"id": "hp_05", "timestamp": "1993-09-02T08:00:00Z", "type": "text", "body": "Ron Weasley's pet is a fat, elderly rat named Scabbers. Hermione Granger's pet is a ginger cat named Crookshanks."}
{"id": "hp_06", "timestamp": "1994-09-01T09:00:00Z", "type": "text", "body": "Alastor 'Mad-Eye' Moody has joined the staff and teaches Defence Against the Dark Arts this year."}
{"id": "hp_07", "timestamp": "1995-06-20T12:00:00Z", "type": "text", "body": "Cornelius Fudge is the Minister for Magic."}
{"id": "hp_08", "timestamp": "1995-09-01T09:00:00Z", "type": "text", "body": "The Ministry has installed Dolores Umbridge as the Defence Against the Dark Arts teacher this year."}
{"id": "hp_09", "timestamp": "1996-07-01T10:00:00Z", "type": "text", "body": "Rufus Scrimgeour has replaced Cornelius Fudge as Minister for Magic."}
{"id": "hp_10", "timestamp": "1996-09-01T09:00:00Z", "type": "text", "body": "At last Severus Snape is the Defence Against the Dark Arts teacher this year. Ron's old rat Scabbers is long gone; he now keeps a tiny, excitable owl named Pigwidgeon."}
